&lt;p&gt;Kestrel&#x27;s security team protects payment flows for 12,000 merchants across South-East Europe.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Requirements&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;You have 3+ years in a security operations or SOC role&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Hands-on with Splunk or Elastic&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Experience securing Kubernetes workloads&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Professional English: our working language is English&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Nice to have&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;CISSP or a similar certification&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Ideally 5+ years working in a SOC or CERT&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We work hybrid, two days a week together at Business Park Sofia.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Package: 5.5&amp;ndash;7k + annual bonus, paid monthly.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are unable to sponsor visas for this role.&lt;/p&gt;
